              "value": "{\\int }_{\\pi /4}^{\\pi }{\\int }_{0}^{1}(\\operatorname{sin}⁡\\theta +\\operatorname{cos}⁡\\theta )\\,\\text{d}r\\,\\text{d}\\theta ",
